    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客我们走出“房间”，与最会跑步的主持人林玮婕、老朋友梁文道一起聊聊今年突然大火的陆冲、飞盘、骑行、腰旗橄榄球、攀岩、露营等这些户外的运动。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..jpg!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「嘉宾」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>林玮婕</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>通晓英语、德语的新闻主播、前凤凰卫视记者、主持人、新闻主播。平日热衷跑步运动，曾多次参加东京、雅典、上海等多场国际马拉松赛，并顺利完成比赛。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>梁文道</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>文化评论人、传媒人、策划人，《纯属叙构》常驻嘉宾。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「主播」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>@Moe 毛衣；@纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><span>Moe毛衣 — 品牌战略师、体验设计师，产品经理和文化项目策划及出品人；拥有多年跨界经验的他曾任职国际4A广告公司品牌创意总监、手游工作室出品人及精品酒店品牌的创始人。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「延伸资料」</span></h4><span></span><h4><span>「音乐」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>Chocolate Lullaby - Mr.asbo &amp; SoulSpeak</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「互动方式」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>微信服务号：🔍Fiction纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514"><span>🔍Fiction纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：info@6-degrees.co</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「线上展场」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>小红书：🔍</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/611cc8670000000001005b75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1645506905" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/611cc8670000000001005b75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1645506905"><span>纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/613adef50000000002025823?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1661840643" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/613adef50000000002025823?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1661840643"><span>🔍Fiction</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5e9e