    <guid isPermaLink="false">6304c043761895ce11cc0755</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Aug 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h4><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></h4><span></span><p><strong><span>李化迪（Howie Lee）-</span></strong><span> 音乐制作人、Do Hits厂牌主理人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Lydia</span></strong><span> -“边顶”品牌创始人</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「主播」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>@Moe 毛衣；@纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>Moe毛衣 — 品牌战略师、体验设计师，产品经理和文化项目策划及出品人；拥有多年跨界经验的他曾任职国际4A广告公司品牌创意总监、手游工作室出品人及精品酒店品牌的创始人。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnCMuJvB3KaWri4REUCchmzqwbVf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>「收听提示」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>前不久我跟着几位朋友去了趟西藏，与他们同行可以到达一些更本地的目的地，认识一些当地的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这趟旅程除了被高反折磨外，也被西藏的各种感官体验所吸引。本期《纯属叙构》希望与你分享一些西藏的“声音”。</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「延伸资料」</span></h4><span></span><h4><span>「音乐」</span></h4><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>Chocolate Lullaby - Mr.asbo &amp; SoulSpeak</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>藏地实验作品Demo-李化迪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>藏戏唱腔 - 普穷/梅朵/平措</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>芒康弦子舞 阿里拉姆 - 边巴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>甜蜜蜜- 黑鸟</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>锅庄起舞-三智才让</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Compassion - Lama Lobsang Palden/Jim Becker</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>无由颂 - 李化迪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>shambala- beastie boys</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>bodhisattva vow - beastie boys</span></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ol><span></span><h4><span>「互动方式」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>微信服务号：🔍Fiction纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：🔍</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514"><span>Fiction纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：info@6-degrees.co</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「线上展场」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>小红书：🔍</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/611cc8670000000001005b75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000