    <title>EP22. 房间里的旅行|在一起吃，才是家宴的重点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62dfbc7bfa15142e1725205a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62dfbc7bfa15142e1725205a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Jul 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「本期嘉宾」</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>杨大壹</span></p><span></span><p><span>《文化有限》主播；看理想《八分》编辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>田螺姑娘</span></p><span></span><p><span>美食作家，著有《家常菜的制胜一击》，《愉快地吃，痛快地瘦》等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：🔍田螺姑娘hhhaze</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博： 🔍</span><a href="https://m.weibo.cn/u/1680554843?uid=1680554843&amp;t=0&amp;luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=100103type%3D1%26q%3D%E7%94%B0%E8%9E%BA%E5%A7%91%E5%A8%98" data-url="https://m.weibo.cn/u/1680554843?uid=1680554843&amp;t=0&amp;luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=100103type%3D1%26q%3D%E7%94%B0%E8%9E%BA%E5%A7%91%E5%A8%98"><span>田螺姑娘_hhhaze</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：🔍 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557649bc484fb62570c2da33?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1658881132" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/557649bc484fb62570c2da33?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1658881132"><span>田螺姑娘_hhhaze</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「收听提示」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>吃什么、怎么吃，很多时候带着每个人不同的生活态度与个性，各有风味。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们去到朋友的房间里旅行，通过一场家宴聊聊味觉记忆、如作品般的家宴以及与家人朋友相聚的回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>家宴，最重要的是大家坐在一起。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fr8qI_BeWsB9TkChMBhQVFNKGSJJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><h4><span>「主播」</span></h4><span></span><p><span>@Moe 毛衣；@纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Moe毛衣 — 品牌战略师、体验设计师，产品经理和文化项目策划及出品人；拥有多年跨界经验的他曾任职国际4A广告公司品牌创意总监、手游工作室出品人及精品酒店品牌的创始人。</span></p><span></span><h4><br></h4><span></span><h4><br></h4><span></span><h4><span>「延伸资料」</span></h4><span></span><h4><span>音乐</span></h4><span></span><p><span>Chocolate Lullaby - Mr.asbo &amp; SoulSpeak</span></p><span></span><h4><strong><span>电影</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>《饮食男女》</span></p><span></span><h4><span>「本节目由Fiction纯属叙构出品」</span></h4><span></span><h4><span>互动方式</span></h4><span></span><p><span>微信服务号：🔍Fiction纯属叙构</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：🔍</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7722980514"><span>Fiction纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：info@6-degrees.co</span></p><span></span><h4><span>线上展场</span></h4><span></span><p><span>小红书：🔍</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/611cc8670000000001005b75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1645506905" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/611cc8670000000001005b75?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c2b25600000000007000c4f&amp;apptime=1645506905"><span>纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>淘宝：🔍</span><a href="https://m.tb.cn/h.fyOkE5v?tk=Ciy62rt1xUL" data-url="https://m.tb.cn/h.fyOkE5v?tk=Ciy62rt1xUL"><span>Fiction纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>QQ音乐：🔍</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/playlist/8354376212" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/playlist/8354376212"><span>纯属叙构|城市旅行</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>网易云：🔍</span><a href="https://y.music.163.com/m/user?id=6399931870" data-url="https://y.music.163.com/m/user?id=6399931870"><span>纯属叙构</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢“茉莉字型”对本节目封面中文字体设计的支持。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
